// win32_runtime.cpp — unified runtime for the native port.
//
// Combines:
//   - Remill __remill_* intrinsics (memory, control flow, flags)
//   - Win32 import dispatch (IAT slot → native implementation)
//   - Flat memory model
//   - Jump table dispatch for indirect jumps
//
// This is the runtime that the real port uses. It replaces the per-tranche
// runtimes with a single, extensible framework.
