            // and imports are this port's cooperative scheduling points
            // (bo2-spin-inside-one-lifted-block). It is not blocked and it is not
            // corrupt: it simply never reaches a yield. [CUR-LIFE] measured
            // 5,999,135 opcodes for it against 4 for its neighbour.
